  "contentHtml": "<p>몇 년 전 찍어놓은 사진입니다.</p><p>제가 했던 수업들도 찾아보지 않으면 뭘 했는지 기억이 안 납니다..ㅠㅠ</p><p>안 찾아보고 넘어갔으면 퍼즐세포를 못 보고 넘어갔을 것 같네요</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; text-align: justify;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; text-align: justify;\">봉숭아 관다발..</span><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2255243B5397F3C111\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"550\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"550\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"img_0928_rorosh.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_2255243B5397F3C1119525\"/></p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13px; text-align: center;\"></p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13px; text-align: center;\">동백나무 잎의 속구조</p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13px; text-align: center;\">빽빽한 책상조직(울타리조직)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13px; text-align: center;\">엉성한 해면조직(스펀지 조직)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2523563B5397F3C204\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"550\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"550\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"img_0937_rorosh.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_2523563B5397F3C20431EC\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; text-align: justify;\">중학교 공변세포관찰의 기본, 자주달개비</span><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2675743B5397F3C20C\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"550\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"550\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"img_0910자주달개비_rorosh.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_2675743B5397F3C20CCFC4\"/></p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13px; text-align: justify;\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13px; text-align: center;\">베고니아 잎 뒷면의 표피와 공변세포.</p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13px; text-align: center;\">특이하게도 공변세포가 3~4쌍으로 뭉쳐있다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2267253B5397F3C321\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"550\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"550\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"img_0912베고니아_rorosh.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_2267253B5397F3C321F3AF\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13px; text-align: center;\">관다발 관찰 후 봉숭아 잎 뒷면을 벗겨 관찰했더니 나온 퍼즐 문양</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2169A53B5397F3C621\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"550\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"550\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"img_0922qh봉숭아_rorosh.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_2169A53B5397F3C6214FCB\"/></p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13px; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13px; text-align: center;\">봉숭아 잎 뒷면 표피세포와 공변세포 확대사진</p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13px; text-align: center;\">공변세포는 저기 얇은 조리퐁</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/246BA33B5397F3C60D\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"550\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"550\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"img_0923봉숭아_rorosh.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_246BA33B5397F3C60DFACA\"/></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
